    "\u{1b}[35m│\u{1b}[0m \u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m   \u{1b}[2m 96 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2m│   \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;94mraise\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4m ExceptionGroup(\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;33m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;33mmany errors\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;33m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4m, errors)\u{1b}[0m                                        \u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m \u{1b}[35m│\u{1b}[0m\n" +
