    "\u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m \u{1b}[31m❱ \u{1b}[0m  8 \u{1b}[2m│   │   \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[36mglobals\u{1b}[0m()[name]()                                              \u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m   \u{1b}[2m  9 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2m│   \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[34mexcept\u{1b}[0m \u{1b}[36mBaseException\u{1b}[0m:                                              \u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m\n" +
