    "\u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m \u{1b}[31m❱ \u{1b}[0m 47 \u{1b}[2m│   │   \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;34mraise\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;36mValueError\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4m(\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;33m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;33mValueError caused by ZeroDivisionError\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;33m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4m) \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;4;34mfro\u{1b}[0m \u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m\n" +
