    "\u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m   \u{1b}[2m  7 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2m│   \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[94mtry\u{1b}[0m:                                                     \u{1b}[31m│\u{1b}[0m\n" +
